Zero point energy                ...      0.13476871 Eh      84.57 kcal/mol
Thermal vibrational correction   ...      0.00815780 Eh       5.12 kcal/mol
Thermal rotational correction    ...      0.00141627 Eh       0.89 kcal/mol
